<view class="guide">
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon">
      <view class="tool-icon select-icon"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">选择：点选对象后可拖动位置；空白处单指拖动可平移视图。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon gesture-icon"></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">双指：捏合可缩放画板，双指拖动可平移视图。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon pen-icon"><view class="pen-tip"></view></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">画笔：选择颜色和粗细后，在画板上自由绘制。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon eraser-icon"></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">橡皮：使用白色笔迹覆盖已有内容。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon image-icon"></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">插图：从相册或相机插入图片，可继续在上面批注。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon save-icon"></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">保存：保存为可继续编辑的本地文件，可在“作品”中查看。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-item">
    <view class="tutorial-icon"><view class="tool-icon export-icon"></view></view>
    <view class="tutorial-text">导出：将当前画板内容保存为图片到系统相册。</view>
  </view>
</view>
